Package: nbashotpackage
Title: Locations of Shots in NBA Games from the 2001-2002 and 2021-2022 NBA seasons.
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Aidan", "Scott", , "scottaidan0403@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: The purpose of this package is to investigate how the shot selection in the National Basketball League (NBA) has changed over time. Specifically comparing shot type (2-pointers or 3-pointers) in the 2001-2002 and 2021-2022 NBA seasons.
